 "text": "PUBLIC NOTICE - Geographic Information System (GIS)\nSkip to content\nHere's how you know\nAn official Lake County Ohio government website.\nHere's how you know\nOfficial websites use .gov\nA .gov website belongs to an official government organization in the United States.\nSecure .gov websites use HTTPS\nA\nlock (\n) or https:// means you've safely connected to the . gov website . Share sensitive information only on official, secure websites .\nDepartments\nElected Officials\nCommunities\nTerms Of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\n© 2026 Lake County, Ohio. All rights reserved.\nFind what you're looking for\nSearch Lake County for:\nDevelopment\nVote\nPay\nApply\nComprehensive Plan\nDo Business with Lake\nPublic Safety Center Updates\nRegistration Status\nRegister\nDog License\nProperty Tax\nProperty Search\nUtilities\nMarriage License\nLake County Careers\nPublic Assistance\nSenior Volunteer\nHome ▸ Departments ▸ Geographic Information System (GIS)\nPUBLIC NOTICE\nGeographic Information System (GIS)\nDepartment Menu\nDepartment Menu\nHome\nNews and Notices\nGIS Day\nLake Navigator 3.0\nLakeNavigator 3.0 Help\nGIS Data Download\nLake County GIS Hub\nAddressing and Public Safety\nNEW LAKE NAV 4.0 BETA\nThe GIS Board\nFAQ\nLake Public Access\nContact Us\nCategories\nCategories\nDATA\nGEOGRAPHIC INFORMATION SYSTEMS\nIMAGERY\nUncategorized\nGIS BOARD MEETING CANCELED FOR JULY 23, 2025\nThe previously scheduled Lake County Geographic Information System (GIS) Board\nmeeting for Wednesday, July 23, 2025, has been CANCELED. The next regularly scheduled\nmeeting will be on Wednesday, August 27, 2025 . The Lake County GIS Board meeting starts\nat 10 AM in Building B, Room 304 of the Lake County Administrative Center\nView/Download Attachment\nShare\nLake County, Ohio\n105 Main Street • Painesville, OH 44077 • 1-800-899-5253\nDepartments\nElected Officials\nCommunities\nTerms Of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\n© 2026 Lake County, Ohio. All rights reserved.",
